  3i+2: v_i v_{i+14}.  Colouring: for n ≥ 59 a periodic part of period 10 (patterns P0..P9; block
  J < n - n mod 10 - 20 gets P_(J mod 10)) followed by a seam of length n mod 10 + 20 that depends on n mod 10;
  explicit colourings for 29 ≤ n < 59.  A pattern is [outer, spoke, inner] with colours 0..4.
  The tables were found by a SAT search on 2026-10-02 (search/gpsearch.py, search/gp14.json); this file was generated
  by search/gen_gpk.py.  The Lean proof does not depend on the search: all windows are checked by `decide`.
-/
